THE W-031 PIN INTERACTION — checked, no conflict.
`gh pr view 4`: PR #4 (W-031) state OPEN, mergedAt null. It has NOT merged
under me, so the branch tree's pin is still `seen === 30`. But the question is
live, so I answered it on a real merged tree rather than by argument:
  git worktree add --detach merged dcf0c2a; git merge origin/opus/W-031
    merge exit 0, no conflicts (W-031 touches packages/commands/src/verify.ts,
    which is a mutation target, but adds nothing that collides)
  npm run -s format:check                 exit 0
